    "source": "\n**Frame:** Beside it, a second stored notice, older and from somewhere else entirely.\n`15 JULY 2026`. A different repository, a different subject — two design documents and a\nplan. The same bracketed word.\n\n**Action:** The category arrives without the subject.\n\n**Caption:**\n> IT WAS NOT ABOUT THIS BOOK.\n>\n> IT HAPPENED SEVEN WEEKS EARLIER, IN A PROJECT ABOUT SOMETHING ELSE.\n\n**Provenance:** `documented` — `CI-REFUSAL`, Event A. This panel exists to close the\nreading the page would otherwise invite; see the page notes.\n\n",
    "title": "An older notice remains in a different repository context"
